<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Valsad - The Land of Mangoes</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; background: #e8f5e9; display: flex; justify-content: center; padding: 20px; }
        .city-card { background: white; width: 500px; border-radius: 15px; box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); overflow: hidden; border-bottom: 8px solid #f39c12; }
        .header { background: #2ecc71; color: white; padding: 25px; text-align: center; }
        .content { padding: 30px; color: #2c3e50; }
        .feature { margin-bottom: 15px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; padding-bottom: 8px; }
        .label { font-weight: bold; color: #27ae60; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="city-card">
        <div class="header"><h1>🌊 Valsad</h1><p>South Gujarat's Coastal Gem</p></div>
        <div class="content">
            <div class="feature"><span class="label">State:</span><span>Gujarat</span></div>
            <div class="feature"><span class="label">Famous For:</span><span>Alphonso Mangoes</span></div>
            <div class="feature"><span class="label">Major Industry:</span><span>Atul Chemicals</span></div>
            <div class="feature"><span class="label">Landmark:</span><span>Tithal Beach</span></div>
            <div class="feature"><span class="label">Pincode:</span><span>396001</span></div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
